[ 1 2 3 0 4 5 6 7 1 ] S0C.UPRUNS
[ 5 3 1 ] S0C.UPRUNS
[ 1 1 2 2 2 3 1 1 ] S0C.DEDUPE
[ 1 1 2 2 2 3 1 1 ] UNIQUE SORT REVERSE 1 GET
[ 7 7 ] UNIQUE SORT REVERSE 1 GET
[ 2 2 2 1 3 ] S0C.MAJ
[ 1 1 2 2 2 3 1 1 ] S0C.MAJ
[ 5 ] S0C.MAJ
